This repository contains a DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash inference engine built on third-party work.

Strata
  Upstream: https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata, commit 1735d64
  Copyright (c) 2026 Niko1221 and the Strata contributors
  License: MIT (see LICENSE)
  Everything outside the DeepSeek-V4.1 parts comes from upstream Strata: the MoE offload engine (src/, include/,
  sycl/), the server and web app (serve/), the installer (setup.py, setup.sh, the .bat launchers), the tools and
  the docs. The upstream README is kept as docs/STRATA.md. The DeepSeek-V4.1 parts are src/dsv41/,
  include/strata/dsv41/, tools/dsv41/, tests/dsv41/, third_party/llama-dsv41/ and the deepseek-v4.1 support in
  serve/.

llama.cpp / ggml
  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors
  License: MIT (third_party/ggml/LICENSE)
  third_party/ggml/ holds ggml headers (version in third_party/ggml/VERSION.txt).

vcruz305/llama.cpp (DeepSeek-V4.1 support for llama.cpp)
  https://github.com/vcruz305/llama.cpp, branch runtime/deepseek41, base commit
  5210c7c5ed61dddaee6ed476623abf4b63093d16
  License: MIT (as llama.cpp)
  third_party/llama-dsv41/0001-strata-moe-hook.patch is one commit on top of that base (see
  third_party/llama-dsv41/README.md). The fork is the reference the engine is checked against and the build
  dependency of the tools in tools/dsv41/.

DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash GGUF weights
  https://huggingface.co/vcruz305/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-GGUF
  The model files are not part of this repository; they are downloaded from that repository under its own
  license and the DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash model license.
